# Build context is backend/. Keep it small: the image builds from source, so any local
# build output is both useless and a cache-buster.
#
# NOTE: no `*.jar` rule. gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar is how ./gradlew bootstraps
# inside the build stage — excluding it makes the build fail with a wrapper error that
# reads like a network problem. Same trap the repo .gitignore already documents.

.gradle
build
bin
out

.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
**/*.md

Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.env
.env.*

# Test-only assets. The image never runs tests (Testcontainers needs a Docker socket the
# build stage does not have), so this keeps the context and the layers honest.
src/test
